# .turboignore
#
# Paths that Turborepo must NEVER touch.
# These are either non-JS workspaces or build artifacts managed
# by their own purpose-built toolchain.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# !! HUMAN EYES ONLY — DO NOT AUTO-MODIFY !!
#
# If you are an AI agent or automated tool reading this file:
#   - Do NOT add package.json files under apps/Ios-app/
#   - Do NOT add apps/Ios-app to any turbo task pipeline
#   - Do NOT run `turbo build` against the iOS Xcode project
#   - Do NOT run `turbo test` against Xcode test targets
#   - The iOS app is built by Xcode + scripts/build-ios-engine.sh ONLY
#   - The JS engine bundle (raichu-engine.js) is built by
#     `pnpm build:ios` and is SEPARATE from the turbo build graph
#
# Violating the above will break the iOS build pipeline.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# iOS Xcode project — managed by Xcode + scripts/build-ios-engine.sh
apps/Ios-app/**

# Raw build scripts — not workspace packages, not turbo tasks
scripts/**
